        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Photoshop Tools Guide</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Helvetica Neue\", Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n        background-color: #f7f9fa;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        color: #111;\n    }\n    .header {\n        background-color: #72c5b9;\n        color: #ffffff;\n        text-align: center;\n        padding: 12px 10px;\n        font-size: 20px;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        letter-spacing: 1px;\n    }\n    .container {\n        padding: 20px 25px;\n        max-width: 800px;\n        margin: 0 auto;\n    }\n    .list-item {\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: flex-start;\n        margin-bottom: 16px;\n    }\n    .number-circle {\n        width: 26px;\n        height: 26px;\n        border: 1.5px solid #222;\n        border-radius: 50%;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: center;\n        align-items: center;\n        font-size: 16px;\n        margin-right: 12px;\n        flex-shrink: 0;\n        background-color: transparent;\n        box-sizing: border-box;\n        margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .text-content {\n        display: flex;\n        flex-direction: column;\n    }\n    .main-text {\n        font-size: 16px;\n        font-weight: 700;\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .shortcut {\n        color: #17938e;\n    }\n    .subtitle {\n        font-size: 13.5px;\n        color: #17938e;\n        font-style: italic;\n        line-height: 1.2;\n    }\n    .underlined {\n        border-bottom: 1.5px solid #222;\n        padding-bottom: 1px;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n    画红线的是在我们摄影当中常用的工具可以着重学习\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"container\">\n    \n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">1</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">移动工具 画板工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(V)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">移动选取或画面主题</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">2</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">套索工具 多边形套索工具 磁性套索 <span class=\"shortcut\">(L)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">创建手绘选取</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">3</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">裁剪工具 透视裁剪工具 切片工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(C)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">裁切或扩展画面边缘</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">4</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\"><span class=\"underlined\">修补工具 污点修复画笔工具 修补工具 内容感知移动工具</span> <span class=\"shortcut\">(J)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">去除瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">5</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\"><span class=\"underlined\">仿制图章工具</span> 图案图章工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(S)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">磨皮去瑕疵的常用工具</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">6</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">橡皮擦工具 背景橡皮擦工具 魔术橡皮擦工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(E)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">擦除画面，经常结合蒙版使用</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">7</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">锐化工具 模糊工具 涂抹工具 锐化图像中的柔边</div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">锐化图像柔边</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">8</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">钢笔工具 自由钢笔工具 弯度钢笔工具 添加描点工具 删除描点工具<br>删除描点工具 转换点工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(P)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">抠图常用工具</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">9</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">路径选择工具 直接选择工具 <span class=\"shortcut\">(A)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">选择抠图路径一般结合钢笔工具使用</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">10</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">抓手工具<span class=\"shortcut\">(H)</span>或<span class=\"shortcut\">(空格)</span> 旋转视图工具<span class=\"shortcut\">(R)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">拖动整个图像的工具</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">11</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">矩形选框工具 椭圆选框工具<span class=\"shortcut\">(M)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">创建矩形或圆形选取</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"list-item\">\n        <div class=\"number-circle\">12</div>\n        <div class=\"text-content\">\n            <div class=\"main-text\">快速选择工具 魔棒工具<span class=\"shortcut\">(W)</span></div>\n            <div class=\"subtitle\">选择色彩类似的图像区域</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
